OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fdying out to leave a mostly dry
OL,7,Fevening with some clear spells.
OL,8,FRemaining clear across Cornwall but
OL,9,Fcloud and rain are expected to push
OL,10,Finto eastern areas through the early
OL,11,Fhours. Hill fog likely.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FBright to start the day for
OL,14,Fmany with any lingering cloud and rain
OL,15,Fto the east gradually clearing.
OL,16,FLengthy sunny spells, before cloud and
OL,17,Frain spill into the west later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
