OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWindier on Wednesday with heavy rain
OL,7,Ffollowed by sunshine and showers.
OL,8,FBrighter and calmer on Thursday,
OL,9,Fbefore turning very unsettled
OL,10,Fovernight. Severe gales and heavy rain
OL,11,Flikely on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
